  96:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c **** 
  97:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c **** /**
  98:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c ****   * @brief  This is a buffered command to set a motor torque ramp. This commands
  99:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c ****   *         don't become active as soon as it is called but it will be executed
 100:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c ****   *         when the pSTM state is START_RUN or RUN. User can check the status
 101:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c ****   *         of the command calling the MCI_IsCommandAcknowledged method.
 102:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c ****   * @param  pHandle Pointer on the component instance to work on.
 103:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c ****   * @param  hFinalTorque is the value of motor torque reference at the end of
 104:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c ****   *         the ramp. This value represents actually the Iq current expressed in
 105:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c ****   *         digit.
 106:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c ****   *         To convert current expressed in Amps to current expressed in digit
 107:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c ****   *         is possible to use the formula:
 108:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c ****   *         Current (digit) = [Current(Amp) * 65536 * Rshunt * Aop] / Vdd micro.
 109:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c ****   * @param  hDurationms the duration of the ramp expressed in milliseconds. It
 110:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c ****   *         is possible to set 0 to perform an instantaneous change in the
 111:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c ****   *         value.
 112:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c ****   * @retval none.
 113:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_interface.c ****   */
